# Agent scratch notes. These are working notes from an automated review round —
# never part of the product — and this is a PUBLIC repo, so a stray one lands in a
# PR diff for everyone to read. Two had already been committed. Anchored with a
# leading slash so it ignores exactly the two places they have appeared without
# hiding a legitimately-named file deeper in the tree.
/findings.md
/frontend/findings.md
